00:00:09.390 --> 00:00:12.310
<i>The divine words come to mind,
then disappears.</i>

00:00:12.310 --> 00:00:14.310
<i>But during that time, it flickers.</i>

00:00:14.930 --> 00:00:17.230
<i>This evening's entertainment
speaks to such tidings.</i>

00:00:17.690 --> 00:00:20.860
<i>It's about an unresolvable grudge
that is yet satisfied.</i>

